{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115041017070-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115051952\"/><p>遇襲男子送院救治。</p><p>灣仔發生傷人案。今日(15日)凌晨3時44分，一名男子報案，指其男友人在皇后大道中29號遇襲受傷。救援人員到場發現事主面部被𠝹傷，經初步治理傷勢後，送往瑪麗醫院救治。警員正調查事件起因，並追緝兇徒歸案。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T21:31:00.386205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:10:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T21:24:24.390250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T21:24:24.390250+00:00","content_hash":"9f9ad71ba754f22d0c538bba5877f11f345c34ddf1edf0c354cf59f9c56c70f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}